OL,3,AFormer journalist and Lost Lives author
OL,4,ADavid McKittrick dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe renowned journalist and author
OL,7,FDavid McKittrick has died.
OL,9,FMcKittrick was best known for his work
OL,10,Fduring the Troubles, and the book Lost
OL,11,FLives.
OL,13,FThe book detailed the people who died
OL,14,Fas a result of the Troubles.
OL,16,FIt was first published in 1999 after
OL,17,Fseveral years of research by McKittrick
OL,18,Fand co-authors Seamus Kelters, Brian
OL,19,FFeeney and Chris Thornton.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
